	"data": "Kyoto University — Graduate School of Informatics\n\nPart of [[projects/grad-school-options|Grad School Options]] research. See also [[projects/mext-scholarship-2029|Mext Scholarship 2029]] for funding details.\n\nOverview\n\nKyoto University offers strong CS fundamentals in one of Japan's most beautiful and culturally rich cities. The Graduate School of Informatics has 6 departments, with Intelligence Science and Technology (IST) and Social Informatics (SOC) being most relevant for XR/HCI. Less…",
